    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stepping out of the waiting room... i dont think i know what you mean by that. it feels like there's no way to actually escape the weight of it. honestly, when you talk about just \"choosing\" to step out of the noise, it almost makes it sound like people have a choice in how they deal with the end. like, is there really any other way to find that kind of stillness besides just... letting go of everything?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
